{{!
    @template tiny_c4lauthor/placeholder_span

    Renders a span with a data-id used as placeholder inside C4L components.

    placeholdertext is text the author selected and is always escaped.
    placeholderhtml is the component's default text from its definition (code or
    admin setting) and may contain markup; it is never taken from the editor.

    @copyright  2026 Roger Segú <rogersegu@gmail.com>
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": "R12345-1717000000",
        "placeholdertext": "Selected text",
        "placeholderhtml": ""
    }
}}
<span data-id="{{id}}">{{#placeholderhtml}}{{{placeholderhtml}}}{{/placeholderhtml}}{{^placeholderhtml}}{{placeholdertext}}{{/placeholderhtml}}</span>
